emaining humans survive against the overwhelming Covenant forces. While doing so, he and Cortana uncover Halo's dark secret and fight to protect all life in the galaxy. \r\n \r\nGame Features:\r\n• PC Settings/Optimizations: Halo: Combat Evolved Anniversary is now optimized for PC and looking better than ever at up to 4k UHD and at 60+ FPS.* Other PC native settings include customizable mouse and keyboard support, ultrawide support, FOV customization, and more. \r\n• Campaign: Experience the second chapter in the Halo saga and fight your way as the Master Chief through 10 unforgettable missions.\r\n• Anniversary Features: Toggle between the remastered graphics in the Anniversary edition and the graphics from the original Halo: Combat Evolved campaign. \r\n• Multiplayer: Continue your Halo adventure with Halo: Combat Evolved Anniversary's iconic multiplayer featuring an updated progression system and over 19 unforgettable maps. \r\n \r\n* Look to system requirements for guidance on hardware minimum specs to achieve performance metrics","ShortDescription":"Halo: Combat Evolved Anniversary comes to PC as the second installment of Halo: The Master Chief Collection, chronicling the rise of the legendary Master Chief. ","DeveloperName":"343 Industries, Bungie","PublisherName":"Xbox Game Studios","PublisherId":"10101150","IsUniversal":false,"Language":"en-us","Price":0.0,"DisplayPrice":"Included","StrikethroughPrice":"​","RecentLowestPriceMessage":"","CurrencyMismatch":false,"AverageRating":3.8,"RatingCount":2032,"HasFreeTrial":false,"ProductType":"Application","ProductFamilyName":"Games","MediaType":"GAMES","ContentIds":[],"PackageFamilyNames":[""],"AlternateIds":[{"$type":"Microsoft.Marketplace.Storefront.Contracts.AlternateId, Microsoft.Marketplace.Storefront.Contracts","AlternateIdType":"LegacyXboxProductId","AlternateIdValue":"51574e39-564d-3053-c042-36334e345200","AlternatedIdTypeString":"LegacyXboxProductId"}],"CollectionItemType":"Product","NumberOfSeasons":0,"Rele